{
  "category": "Iron Claw Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "When two BELDUM fuse together, METANG is formed. The brains of the BELDUM are joined by a magnetic nervous system. By linking its brains magnetically, this POKéMON generates strong psychokinetic power.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "When two BELDUM fuse together, METANG is formed. The brains of the BELDUM are joined by a magnetic nervous system. This POKéMON turns its arms to the rear for traveling at high speed.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "The claws tipping its arms pack the destructive power to tear through thick iron sheets as if they were silk. It flies at over 60 miles per hour.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It floats midair using magnetism. Its body is so tough, even a crash with a jet plane won’t leave a scratch.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It floats midair using magnetism. Its body is so tough, even a crash with a jet plane won’t leave a scratch.",
