    {
      "text": "When two Beldum fuse together, Metang is formed. The brains of the Beldum are joined by a magnetic nervous system. This Pokémon turns its arms to the rear for traveling at high speed.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When two Beldum link together, their psychic power is doubled. Their intelligence, however, remains unchanged.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It adores magnetic minerals, so it pursues Nosepass at speeds exceeding 60 mph.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "With its two brains, it fires powerful psychic energy to stop its prey in their tracks.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It flies at high speeds around the skies. When it finds its prey, Metang takes a firm grip with its sharp claws and never lets go.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Two Beldum have become stuck together via their own magnetic forces. With two brains, the resulting Metang has doubled psychic powers.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using magnetic forces to stay aloft, this Pokémon flies at high speeds, weaving through harsh mountain terrain in pursuit of prey.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
